# Container-scan exceptions — reviewed, not silent.
#
# These advisories hit copies of packages that are NOT runtime dependencies of
# the API image:
#   * msgpack/urllib3 findings below match pip's VENDORED copies under
#     site-packages/pip/_vendor (pip 26.x) — package-manager internals, not
#     imported by the application. The application-level requirements pin
#     msgpack>=1.2.1 and urllib3>=2.8.0 (see backend/requirements.txt).
#   * setuptools matches the base image's /usr/local copy, which the runtime
#     stage upgrades to >= 83.0.0; the venv pins setuptools==83.0.0.
# Remove an entry here only after bumping the offending package everywhere.
